1
00:00:14,554 --> 00:00:15,471
<c.simplifiedchinese>别这样！</c.simplifiedchinese>

2
00:00:16,222 --> 00:00:19,308
<c.simplifiedchinese>我训练时不要在我旁边砍木头！</c.simplifiedchinese>

3
00:00:19,392 --> 00:00:20,977
<c.simplifiedchinese>我集中不了注意力！</c.simplifiedchinese>

4
00:00:21,060 --> 00:00:23,271
<c.simplifiedchinese>但在下得砍木头</c.simplifiedchinese>

5
00:00:23,354 --> 00:00:25,314
<c.simplifiedchinese>至少拿把斧子砍！</c.simplifiedchinese>

6
00:00:25,398 --> 00:00:27,567
<c.simplifiedchinese>这些木头表面太干净了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

7
00:00:27,650 --> 00:00:32,238
<c.simplifiedchinese>不教我任何剑术
就不要用它来做家务！</c.simplifiedchinese>

8
00:00:32,321 --> 00:00:34,032
<c.simplifiedchinese>你们不要吵了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

9
00:00:34,949 --> 00:00:37,368
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们不用吵了</c.simplifiedchinese>

10
00:00:37,452 --> 00:00:39,495
<c.simplifiedchinese>从今往后 我们可以和平相处</c.simplifiedchinese>

11
00:00:40,204 --> 00:00:41,831
<c.simplifiedchinese>怎么回事？</c.simplifiedchinese>

12
00:00:41,914 --> 00:00:43,958
<c.simplifiedchinese>你终于连脑子都开始变丑了吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

13
00:00:46,544 --> 00:00:47,420
<c.simplifiedchinese>我说的是</c.simplifiedchinese>

14
00:00:47,503 --> 00:00:50,673
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们暂时不用担心开支了</c.simplifiedchinese>

15
00:00:50,757 --> 00:00:53,509
<c.simplifiedchinese>我刚刚整理柜子 找到了这个</c.simplifiedchinese>

16
00:00:54,427 --> 00:00:55,595
<c.simplifiedchinese>我爷爷画了…</c.simplifiedchinese>

17
00:00:55,678 --> 00:00:58,139
<c.simplifiedchinese>-涂鸦？
-这是水墨画！</c.simplifiedchinese>

18
00:00:58,723 --> 00:01:03,603
<c.simplifiedchinese>我爷爷也教剑术 同时也画画</c.simplifiedchinese>

19
00:01:03,686 --> 00:01:05,938
<c.simplifiedchinese>我可以把它卖了换钱</c.simplifiedchinese>

20
00:01:06,981 --> 00:01:08,608
<c.simplifiedchinese>谢谢您 爷爷！</c.simplifiedchinese>

21
00:01:08,691 --> 00:01:10,276
<c.simplifiedchinese>女人和钱</c.simplifiedchinese>

22
00:01:13,613 --> 00:01:15,364
<c.simplifiedchinese>哈？什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

23
00:01:18,201 --> 00:01:21,788
<c.simplifiedchinese>所以说 为了庆祝
我们去吃牛锅吧！</c.simplifiedchinese>

24
00:01:21,871 --> 00:01:24,665
<c.simplifiedchinese>我刚刚还很听话 你却欺负我</c.simplifiedchinese>

25
00:01:24,749 --> 00:01:25,958
<c.simplifiedchinese>你这个丑女！</c.simplifiedchinese>

26
00:01:26,042 --> 00:01:29,712
<c.simplifiedchinese>除了叫丑女也不会叫别的了
因为你太蠢了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

27
00:01:29,796 --> 00:01:31,798
<c.simplifiedchinese>-什么？
-真是的</c.simplifiedchinese>

28
00:01:31,881 --> 00:01:32,882
<c.simplifiedchinese>-想怎么样？
-怎么样？</c.simplifiedchinese>

29
00:01:48,731 --> 00:01:52,151
<c.simplifiedchinese>（原作：和月伸宏
集英社《周刊少年JUMP》）</c.simplifiedchinese>

30
00:03:08,352 --> 00:03:13,065
<c.simplifiedchinese>明治维新的影响很大</c.simplifiedchinese>

31
00:03:13,149 --> 00:03:17,320
<c.simplifiedchinese>像引入了很多种类的新菜式</c.simplifiedchinese>

32
00:03:17,403 --> 00:03:21,699
<c.simplifiedchinese>如牛锅 现在叫寿喜烧</c.simplifiedchinese>

33
00:03:21,782 --> 00:03:24,118
<c.simplifiedchinese>普通人消费得起 广受欢迎</c.simplifiedchinese>

34
00:03:24,201 --> 00:03:27,204
<c.simplifiedchinese>一展西方厨艺的影响力</c.simplifiedchinese>

35
00:03:28,789 --> 00:03:31,500
<c.simplifiedchinese>那样我们永远也得不到自己的权利！</c.simplifiedchinese>

36
00:03:31,584 --> 00:03:34,045
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们要更激进点…</c.simplifiedchinese>

37
00:03:34,128 --> 00:03:37,715
<c.simplifiedchinese>那等于将板垣老师置于死地！</c.simplifiedchinese>

38
00:03:37,798 --> 00:03:42,803
<c.simplifiedchinese>对！大久保内务省还不管大西乡！</c.simplifiedchinese>

39
00:03:42,887 --> 00:03:48,267
<c.simplifiedchinese>谁不想死后
成为像大西乡一样的传奇人物？</c.simplifiedchinese>

40
00:03:48,351 --> 00:03:49,227
<c.simplifiedchinese>你这个傻瓜</c.simplifiedchinese>

41
00:03:49,310 --> 00:03:52,063
<c.simplifiedchinese>成为传奇人物没有任何好处</c.simplifiedchinese>

42
00:03:52,146 --> 00:03:53,731
<c.simplifiedchinese>欢迎光临</c.simplifiedchinese>

43
00:03:53,814 --> 00:03:55,066
<c.simplifiedchinese>噢 是你 薰</c.simplifiedchinese>

44
00:03:55,149 --> 00:03:57,568
<c.simplifiedchinese>好久不见 妙小姐</c.simplifiedchinese>

45
00:03:57,652 --> 00:03:59,403
<c.simplifiedchinese>你看起来越来越好了</c.simplifiedchinese>

46
00:04:00,154 --> 00:04:01,864
<c.simplifiedchinese>那位是你的爱人吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

47
00:04:02,657 --> 00:04:05,159
<c.simplifiedchinese>不是！他只是在道场借宿</c.simplifiedchinese>

48
00:04:08,204 --> 00:04:11,666
<c.simplifiedchinese>板垣老师死了 就没有自由了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

49
00:04:11,749 --> 00:04:12,875
<c.simplifiedchinese>不可能！</c.simplifiedchinese>

50
00:04:12,959 --> 00:04:15,836
<c.simplifiedchinese>即使板垣老师死了 自由还在！</c.simplifiedchinese>

51
00:04:15,920 --> 00:04:18,798
<c.simplifiedchinese>事实上 如果老师以这种方式离世…</c.simplifiedchinese>

52
00:04:18,881 --> 00:04:22,260
<c.simplifiedchinese>听起来像自由民权运动的支持者</c.simplifiedchinese>

53
00:04:22,343 --> 00:04:25,513
<c.simplifiedchinese>一派胡言</c.simplifiedchinese>

54
00:04:25,596 --> 00:04:27,890
<c.simplifiedchinese>他们只是喝醉了</c.simplifiedchinese>

55
00:04:27,974 --> 00:04:29,600
<c.simplifiedchinese>不必理会</c.simplifiedchinese>

56
00:04:29,684 --> 00:04:31,936
<c.simplifiedchinese>总之先来三份牛锅吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

57
00:04:32,019 --> 00:04:34,605
<c.simplifiedchinese>嗯 再来三杯咖啡 谢谢</c.simplifiedchinese>

58
00:04:34,689 --> 00:04:37,149
<c.simplifiedchinese>你心情很好呢 薰女…</c.simplifiedchinese>

59
00:04:37,900 --> 00:04:39,026
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心？</c.simplifiedchinese>

60
00:04:40,278 --> 00:04:41,112
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心！</c.simplifiedchinese>

61
00:04:43,698 --> 00:04:45,908
<c.simplifiedchinese>再说一遍！</c.simplifiedchinese>

62
00:04:45,992 --> 00:04:48,995
<c.simplifiedchinese>你们可能没注意到
但你们刚刚扔的瓶子砸到人了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

63
00:04:49,078 --> 00:04:51,956
<c.simplifiedchinese>道歉了再讨论！</c.simplifiedchinese>

64
00:04:52,039 --> 00:04:54,250
<c.simplifiedchinese>像你这样的小屁孩</c.simplifiedchinese>

65
00:04:54,333 --> 00:04:57,920
<c.simplifiedchinese>有什么权利
对人权捍卫者说三道四？</c.simplifiedchinese>

66
00:04:58,004 --> 00:04:59,714
<c.simplifiedchinese>废话少说！</c.simplifiedchinese>

67
00:04:59,797 --> 00:05:01,799
<c.simplifiedchinese>我叫你们这些酒鬼道歉呢！</c.simplifiedchinese>

68
00:05:02,425 --> 00:05:03,384
<c.simplifiedchinese>冷静</c.simplifiedchinese>

69
00:05:03,467 --> 00:05:05,469
<c.simplifiedchinese>竟敢叫我们酒鬼！</c.simplifiedchinese>

70
00:05:05,553 --> 00:05:07,221
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们是捍卫…</c.simplifiedchinese>

71
00:05:07,305 --> 00:05:10,182
<c.simplifiedchinese>闭嘴！喝醉了就是酒鬼！</c.simplifiedchinese>

72
00:05:10,266 --> 00:05:11,475
<c.simplifiedchinese>你说什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

73
00:05:11,559 --> 00:05:14,895
<c.simplifiedchinese>先生…请不要惹麻烦</c.simplifiedchinese>

74
00:05:14,979 --> 00:05:16,397
<c.simplifiedchinese>闭嘴！</c.simplifiedchinese>

75
00:05:16,480 --> 00:05:18,441
<c.simplifiedchinese>-妙小姐！
-小心！</c.simplifiedchinese>

76
00:05:19,734 --> 00:05:24,030
<c.simplifiedchinese>自由民权运动是为弱者着想的</c.simplifiedchinese>

77
00:05:24,113 --> 00:05:28,242
<c.simplifiedchinese>支持这份事业的人不该如此表现</c.simplifiedchinese>

78
00:05:29,785 --> 00:05:31,162
<c.simplifiedchinese>还是说</c.simplifiedchinese>

79
00:05:31,245 --> 00:05:36,500
<c.simplifiedchinese>你们说的自由
指的是醉酒惹事的自由？</c.simplifiedchinese>

80
00:05:36,584 --> 00:05:40,296
<c.simplifiedchinese>-你说什么？
-找打吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

81
00:05:41,714 --> 00:05:45,134
<c.simplifiedchinese>当然 听起来也不错</c.simplifiedchinese>

82
00:05:45,760 --> 00:05:48,262
<c.simplifiedchinese>一般都会有人找我打架</c.simplifiedchinese>

83
00:05:49,013 --> 00:05:53,100
<c.simplifiedchinese>但我讨厌欺负弱小的人</c.simplifiedchinese>

84
00:05:53,684 --> 00:05:57,938
<c.simplifiedchinese>而且我真的很鄙视那些</c.simplifiedchinese>

85
00:05:58,022 --> 00:06:03,861
<c.simplifiedchinese>对自由、正义、平等
那些美好事物夸夸其谈的人</c.simplifiedchinese>

86
00:06:03,944 --> 00:06:05,488
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们出去解决！</c.simplifiedchinese>

87
00:06:08,032 --> 00:06:09,867
<c.simplifiedchinese>（红牛牛锅）</c.simplifiedchinese>

88
00:06:09,950 --> 00:06:11,827
<c.simplifiedchinese>事态向奇怪的方向发展了</c.simplifiedchinese>

89
00:06:12,495 --> 00:06:14,455
<c.simplifiedchinese>要上前阻止吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

90
00:06:14,538 --> 00:06:17,792
<c.simplifiedchinese>他想打 还是别阻止了</c.simplifiedchinese>

91
00:06:18,375 --> 00:06:20,002
<c.simplifiedchinese>先看看你有什么能耐</c.simplifiedchinese>

92
00:06:20,711 --> 00:06:22,213
<c.simplifiedchinese>试一下</c.simplifiedchinese>

93
00:06:24,507 --> 00:06:26,342
<c.simplifiedchinese>臭小子！接招！</c.simplifiedchinese>

94
00:06:28,719 --> 00:06:30,846
<c.simplifiedchinese>胆小鬼！他藏了把寸铁！</c.simplifiedchinese>

95
00:06:30,930 --> 00:06:31,889
<c.simplifiedchinese>不要叫！</c.simplifiedchinese>

96
00:06:31,972 --> 00:06:34,809
<c.simplifiedchinese>寸铁应该是秘密武器！</c.simplifiedchinese>

97
00:06:36,227 --> 00:06:38,521
<c.simplifiedchinese>他们说得对</c.simplifiedchinese>

98
00:06:39,772 --> 00:06:40,731
<c.simplifiedchinese>但是…</c.simplifiedchinese>

99
00:06:41,774 --> 00:06:43,442
<c.simplifiedchinese>没关系</c.simplifiedchinese>

100
00:06:46,362 --> 00:06:48,989
<c.simplifiedchinese>用了寸铁也还就这点能耐吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

101
00:06:49,073 --> 00:06:50,574
<c.simplifiedchinese>你说什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

102
00:06:50,658 --> 00:06:51,867
<c.simplifiedchinese>喂…</c.simplifiedchinese>

103
00:06:52,576 --> 00:06:54,787
<c.simplifiedchinese>你…你的右手…</c.simplifiedchinese>

104
00:07:01,085 --> 00:07:03,420
<c.simplifiedchinese>你…你做了什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

105
00:07:03,504 --> 00:07:05,631
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么都没做</c.simplifiedchinese>

106
00:07:06,507 --> 00:07:09,343
<c.simplifiedchinese>-你还好吗？
-没事！</c.simplifiedchinese>

107
00:07:09,426 --> 00:07:12,763
<c.simplifiedchinese>为自由而战更难！</c.simplifiedchinese>

108
00:07:12,847 --> 00:07:15,224
<c.simplifiedchinese>没错 为你自豪！</c.simplifiedchinese>

109
00:07:15,307 --> 00:07:18,519
<c.simplifiedchinese>用尽全力的话就是霸凌了</c.simplifiedchinese>

110
00:07:19,061 --> 00:07:21,188
<c.simplifiedchinese>我用一根手指就可以拿下你</c.simplifiedchinese>

111
00:07:21,272 --> 00:07:23,983
<c.simplifiedchinese>不要小瞧我 接招！</c.simplifiedchinese>

112
00:07:32,324 --> 00:07:34,660
<c.simplifiedchinese>又打了一场无聊的架</c.simplifiedchinese>

113
00:07:35,453 --> 00:07:37,121
<c.simplifiedchinese>一弹就…</c.simplifiedchinese>

114
00:07:37,204 --> 00:07:39,832
<c.simplifiedchinese>-什…什么…
-该死！</c.simplifiedchinese>

115
00:07:39,915 --> 00:07:43,586
<c.simplifiedchinese>喝醉酒惹是生非 在下可以视而不见</c.simplifiedchinese>

116
00:07:44,295 --> 00:07:48,466
<c.simplifiedchinese>但你想拔剑的话
在下的耐心就到头了</c.simplifiedchinese>

117
00:07:49,884 --> 00:07:52,303
<c.simplifiedchinese>自由民权运动确实是伟大的事业</c.simplifiedchinese>

118
00:07:53,053 --> 00:07:59,685
<c.simplifiedchinese>但改进政府前 得先改进一下自己</c.simplifiedchinese>

119
00:08:00,769 --> 00:08:02,938
<c.simplifiedchinese>快结账回家</c.simplifiedchinese>

120
00:08:07,276 --> 00:08:10,821
<c.simplifiedchinese>非常感谢你的帮助</c.simplifiedchinese>

121
00:08:10,905 --> 00:08:13,449
<c.simplifiedchinese>没什么 这架是我自愿打的</c.simplifiedchinese>

122
00:08:13,532 --> 00:08:15,284
<c.simplifiedchinese>不用谢我</c.simplifiedchinese>

123
00:08:15,868 --> 00:08:19,246
<c.simplifiedchinese>嘿 剑客 你的脑袋还好吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

124
00:08:20,372 --> 00:08:22,625
<c.simplifiedchinese>没事 不要紧</c.simplifiedchinese>

125
00:08:22,708 --> 00:08:24,168
<c.simplifiedchinese>好</c.simplifiedchinese>

126
00:08:24,251 --> 00:08:27,838
<c.simplifiedchinese>故意被打伤的话就太惨了</c.simplifiedchinese>

127
00:08:29,673 --> 00:08:34,887
<c.simplifiedchinese>闪开瓶子的话
瓶子可能就砸到那个女孩脸上了</c.simplifiedchinese>

128
00:08:35,471 --> 00:08:38,807
<c.simplifiedchinese>所以你没动
而是用头挡住了 对吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

129
00:08:39,517 --> 00:08:41,685
<c.simplifiedchinese>太抬举在下了</c.simplifiedchinese>

130
00:08:41,769 --> 00:08:43,270
<c.simplifiedchinese>谦虚？</c.simplifiedchinese>

131
00:08:43,354 --> 00:08:47,024
<c.simplifiedchinese>我喜欢你 打一架怎么样？</c.simplifiedchinese>

132
00:08:47,608 --> 00:08:49,235
<c.simplifiedchinese>谢谢你 但还是算了</c.simplifiedchinese>

133
00:08:49,318 --> 00:08:50,736
<c.simplifiedchinese>好吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

134
00:08:51,612 --> 00:08:54,073
<c.simplifiedchinese>改变主意时告诉我</c.simplifiedchinese>

135
00:08:54,156 --> 00:08:57,243
<c.simplifiedchinese>我住在小镇郊区的流氓宿舍</c.simplifiedchinese>

136
00:08:57,326 --> 00:08:58,536
<c.simplifiedchinese>回见</c.simplifiedchinese>

137
00:08:59,578 --> 00:09:03,374
<c.simplifiedchinese>（恶）</c.simplifiedchinese>

138
00:09:03,457 --> 00:09:05,167
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么情况？</c.simplifiedchinese>

139
00:09:05,251 --> 00:09:07,920
<c.simplifiedchinese>他是好人还是坏人？</c.simplifiedchinese>

140
00:09:08,003 --> 00:09:10,756
<c.simplifiedchinese>品味方面很糟就是了</c.simplifiedchinese>

141
00:09:11,882 --> 00:09:13,884
<c.simplifiedchinese>真是个奇怪的男人</c.simplifiedchinese>

142
00:09:13,968 --> 00:09:17,221
<c.simplifiedchinese>-对了！
-你认识他吗 妙小姐？</c.simplifiedchinese>

143
00:09:17,888 --> 00:09:20,724
<c.simplifiedchinese>他没结账就走了…</c.simplifiedchinese>

144
00:09:26,146 --> 00:09:29,567
<c.simplifiedchinese>你想让我灭了他？</c.simplifiedchinese>

145
00:09:29,650 --> 00:09:33,279
<c.simplifiedchinese>对 我觉得你能做到</c.simplifiedchinese>

146
00:09:33,362 --> 00:09:36,407
<c.simplifiedchinese>不要说得我像刺客一样</c.simplifiedchinese>

147
00:09:36,490 --> 00:09:39,493
<c.simplifiedchinese>我只在乎能不能打一场漂亮的架</c.simplifiedchinese>

148
00:09:42,413 --> 00:09:45,874
<c.simplifiedchinese>但你们是怎么越狱的？</c.simplifiedchinese>

149
00:09:45,958 --> 00:09:49,295
<c.simplifiedchinese>正好说明我们的不满</c.simplifiedchinese>

150
00:09:49,378 --> 00:09:53,257
<c.simplifiedchinese>要不是他出现 一切都会顺利进行…</c.simplifiedchinese>

151
00:09:53,340 --> 00:09:56,010
<c.simplifiedchinese>真没用</c.simplifiedchinese>

152
00:09:56,594 --> 00:09:59,680
<c.simplifiedchinese>那个叫剑心的家伙 他厉害吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

153
00:10:01,724 --> 00:10:03,892
<c.simplifiedchinese>我最近打过的架都好无聊</c.simplifiedchinese>

154
00:10:03,976 --> 00:10:05,978
<c.simplifiedchinese>-有点厌烦了
-他很厉害！</c.simplifiedchinese>

155
00:10:07,021 --> 00:10:10,566
<c.simplifiedchinese>他一拳就把我打倒了</c.simplifiedchinese>

156
00:10:10,649 --> 00:10:11,734
<c.simplifiedchinese>笨蛋！</c.simplifiedchinese>

157
00:10:11,817 --> 00:10:16,030
<c.simplifiedchinese>你死一千次也证明不了他厉害！</c.simplifiedchinese>

158
00:10:16,780 --> 00:10:20,701
<c.simplifiedchinese>请听我说…</c.simplifiedchinese>

159
00:10:22,036 --> 00:10:25,122
<c.simplifiedchinese>那个叫剑心的家伙真的…</c.simplifiedchinese>

160
00:10:27,833 --> 00:10:29,209
<c.simplifiedchinese>是吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

161
00:10:29,293 --> 00:10:31,712
<c.simplifiedchinese>斩左先生 怎么样？</c.simplifiedchinese>

162
00:10:31,795 --> 00:10:35,799
<c.simplifiedchinese>我觉得他是值得打一架的对手</c.simplifiedchinese>

163
00:10:36,634 --> 00:10:37,468
<c.simplifiedchinese>对</c.simplifiedchinese>

164
00:10:38,260 --> 00:10:42,181
<c.simplifiedchinese>甚至可以用它 我都好几年没用过了</c.simplifiedchinese>

165
00:10:42,806 --> 00:10:46,185
<c.simplifiedchinese>传奇的刽子手 绯村拔刀斋！</c.simplifiedchinese>

166
00:10:46,935 --> 00:10:51,940
<c.simplifiedchinese>街头打手斩左
一直想找一个你这样的对手打一架！</c.simplifiedchinese>

167
00:10:56,654 --> 00:11:00,366
<c.simplifiedchinese>传奇的刽子手 绯村拔刀斋！</c.simplifiedchinese>

168
00:11:00,449 --> 00:11:05,996
<c.simplifiedchinese>街头打手斩左
一直想找一个你这样的对手打一架！</c.simplifiedchinese>

169
00:11:06,080 --> 00:11:09,083
<c.simplifiedchinese>他说完那句话后已经离开两周了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

170
00:11:09,166 --> 00:11:11,460
<c.simplifiedchinese>那狂妄自大的人去哪了？</c.simplifiedchinese>

171
00:11:12,127 --> 00:11:15,339
<c.simplifiedchinese>不敢相信他会吓得跑掉了</c.simplifiedchinese>

172
00:11:15,422 --> 00:11:20,010
<c.simplifiedchinese>他明明说：“我期待那场架”</c.simplifiedchinese>

173
00:11:20,719 --> 00:11:22,054
<c.simplifiedchinese>笨蛋！</c.simplifiedchinese>

174
00:11:23,097 --> 00:11:25,057
<c.simplifiedchinese>你才是笨蛋！</c.simplifiedchinese>

175
00:11:25,140 --> 00:11:28,560
<c.simplifiedchinese>再模仿我 我就把你倒挂起来！</c.simplifiedchinese>

176
00:11:28,644 --> 00:11:32,523
<c.simplifiedchinese>斩…斩左先生 您去哪里了？</c.simplifiedchinese>

177
00:11:32,606 --> 00:11:34,608
<c.simplifiedchinese>打架</c.simplifiedchinese>

178
00:11:34,691 --> 00:11:37,611
<c.simplifiedchinese>-另一场吗？
-不是 笨蛋</c.simplifiedchinese>

179
00:11:38,195 --> 00:11:41,782
<c.simplifiedchinese>打架不是从拳打脚踢开始的</c.simplifiedchinese>

180
00:11:41,865 --> 00:11:45,202
<c.simplifiedchinese>但就算我和你解释 你们也听不懂</c.simplifiedchinese>

181
00:11:48,539 --> 00:11:50,457
<c.simplifiedchinese>街头打手斩左</c.simplifiedchinese>

182
00:11:51,083 --> 00:11:55,712
<c.simplifiedchinese>他是享誉东京东部黑社会的职业打手</c.simplifiedchinese>

183
00:11:55,796 --> 00:11:57,798
<c.simplifiedchinese>一匹粗鲁的孤狼</c.simplifiedchinese>

184
00:11:57,881 --> 00:12:02,136
<c.simplifiedchinese>根据自己有多享受打架来决定收费</c.simplifiedchinese>

185
00:12:02,219 --> 00:12:03,929
<c.simplifiedchinese>但他很厉害！</c.simplifiedchinese>

186
00:12:04,012 --> 00:12:06,598
<c.simplifiedchinese>据说那些和他战斗过的人都倍受惊吓</c.simplifiedchinese>

187
00:12:06,682 --> 00:12:10,561
<c.simplifiedchinese>会连做几个月的噩梦
梦里看到“恶”这个字</c.simplifiedchinese>

188
00:12:11,186 --> 00:12:16,400
<c.simplifiedchinese>利用他的话
我们肯定能处理掉那个讨厌的人</c.simplifiedchinese>

189
00:12:16,483 --> 00:12:19,778
<c.simplifiedchinese>绯村拔刀斋！</c.simplifiedchinese>

190
00:12:22,489 --> 00:12:23,574
<c.simplifiedchinese>有客人来了</c.simplifiedchinese>

191
00:12:24,616 --> 00:12:27,661
<c.simplifiedchinese>等一下 剑心 怎么了？</c.simplifiedchinese>

192
00:12:28,412 --> 00:12:29,913
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下感受到他的气了</c.simplifiedchinese>

193
00:12:31,248 --> 00:12:35,836
<c.simplifiedchinese>这种傻里傻气
直截了当的斗志是藏不住的</c.simplifiedchinese>

194
00:12:37,880 --> 00:12:40,174
<c.simplifiedchinese>我是来打架的</c.simplifiedchinese>

195
00:12:40,257 --> 00:12:41,967
<c.simplifiedchinese>是之前那个家伙</c.simplifiedchinese>

196
00:12:42,050 --> 00:12:43,510
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下就猜是你</c.simplifiedchinese>

197
00:12:44,219 --> 00:12:47,097
<c.simplifiedchinese>和你说了 在下不想打</c.simplifiedchinese>

198
00:12:47,681 --> 00:12:49,099
<c.simplifiedchinese>无法接受这个回答</c.simplifiedchinese>

199
00:12:49,183 --> 00:12:51,768
<c.simplifiedchinese>我是作为职业打手来的 不能反悔</c.simplifiedchinese>

200
00:12:51,852 --> 00:12:56,482
<c.simplifiedchinese>尤其是我的目标是爱国者绯村拔刀斋</c.simplifiedchinese>

201
00:12:59,776 --> 00:13:03,864
<c.simplifiedchinese>长州藩出身的维新志士 绯村拔刀斋</c.simplifiedchinese>

202
00:13:03,947 --> 00:13:07,284
<c.simplifiedchinese>习得古流剑术飞天御剑流</c.simplifiedchinese>

203
00:13:07,367 --> 00:13:10,996
<c.simplifiedchinese>14岁至19岁期间活跃于世间</c.simplifiedchinese>

204
00:13:11,079 --> 00:13:13,415
<c.simplifiedchinese>一开始是一位杀手</c.simplifiedchinese>

205
00:13:13,499 --> 00:13:16,126
<c.simplifiedchinese>潜伏在黑暗中的冷血暗杀手</c.simplifiedchinese>

206
00:13:16,210 --> 00:13:22,758
<c.simplifiedchinese>后来 捍卫幕府首领麾下
如新选组等革命剑客</c.simplifiedchinese>

207
00:13:23,467 --> 00:13:27,554
<c.simplifiedchinese>就这样
这位本应不为人知的杀手声名鹊起</c.simplifiedchinese>

208
00:13:27,638 --> 00:13:32,392
<c.simplifiedchinese>在关键的戊辰战争中</c.simplifiedchinese>

209
00:13:32,476 --> 00:13:36,813
<c.simplifiedchinese>第一战鸟羽伏见之战后
销声匿迹作为浪客绯村剑心生活</c.simplifiedchinese>

210
00:13:37,397 --> 00:13:41,652
<c.simplifiedchinese>真正的战斗始于了解敌人后</c.simplifiedchinese>

211
00:13:41,735 --> 00:13:44,530
<c.simplifiedchinese>选择正确的作战方式</c.simplifiedchinese>

212
00:13:44,613 --> 00:13:47,241
<c.simplifiedchinese>我去幕末杀戮的中心京都
查清了这一切</c.simplifiedchinese>

213
00:13:48,367 --> 00:13:51,370
<c.simplifiedchinese>你决定好要和在下打了吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

214
00:13:51,453 --> 00:13:53,372
<c.simplifiedchinese>这才是问题所在！</c.simplifiedchinese>

215
00:13:54,248 --> 00:13:56,708
<c.simplifiedchinese>我调查后 只发现一些
关于你职业生涯的模糊描述</c.simplifiedchinese>

216
00:13:56,792 --> 00:14:00,671
<c.simplifiedchinese>完全没有飞天御剑流相关的描述</c.simplifiedchinese>

217
00:14:00,754 --> 00:14:04,675
<c.simplifiedchinese>以及为什么冷血的刽子手
变成温柔的浪客了</c.simplifiedchinese>

218
00:14:04,758 --> 00:14:07,302
<c.simplifiedchinese>我还没想明白</c.simplifiedchinese>

219
00:14:07,970 --> 00:14:12,933
<c.simplifiedchinese>所以我只想在公平的战斗中
与你正面交锋</c.simplifiedchinese>

220
00:14:15,310 --> 00:14:20,482
<c.simplifiedchinese>哥 你觉得这个斩左真的能赢吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

221
00:14:21,441 --> 00:14:23,402
<c.simplifiedchinese>他的对手是拔刀斋</c.simplifiedchinese>

222
00:14:23,485 --> 00:14:24,903
<c.simplifiedchinese>胜负已定</c.simplifiedchinese>

223
00:14:24,987 --> 00:14:28,866
<c.simplifiedchinese>-什么意思？
-别怕</c.simplifiedchinese>

224
00:14:28,949 --> 00:14:34,121
<c.simplifiedchinese>尽管斩左会输
但他还是非常厉害的打手</c.simplifiedchinese>

225
00:14:34,204 --> 00:14:38,458
<c.simplifiedchinese>即使他会战死 但还是会用心作战
拔刀斋很可能会负伤</c.simplifiedchinese>

226
00:14:39,084 --> 00:14:44,381
<c.simplifiedchinese>战斗结束
他一放松警惕 我就去解决他</c.simplifiedchinese>

227
00:14:44,464 --> 00:14:47,843
<c.simplifiedchinese>用我在横滨市买的这个！</c.simplifiedchinese>

228
00:14:49,303 --> 00:14:51,305
<c.simplifiedchinese>-在下也不明白
-什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

229
00:14:51,388 --> 00:14:54,933
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下见你讨厌欺负弱者的行为</c.simplifiedchinese>

230
00:14:55,017 --> 00:14:58,896
<c.simplifiedchinese>为什么又以街头打手谋生呢？</c.simplifiedchinese>

231
00:14:58,979 --> 00:15:03,859
<c.simplifiedchinese>为什么身后穿着“恶”字呢？</c.simplifiedchinese>

232
00:15:03,942 --> 00:15:09,448
<c.simplifiedchinese>你的灵魂是正直的
但现在你却非常别扭</c.simplifiedchinese>

233
00:15:09,531 --> 00:15:13,577
<c.simplifiedchinese>是什么把你变成这样的？</c.simplifiedchinese>

234
00:15:13,660 --> 00:15:14,912
<c.simplifiedchinese>你问的是…</c.simplifiedchinese>

235
00:15:19,750 --> 00:15:21,001
<c.simplifiedchinese>等一下</c.simplifiedchinese>

236
00:15:21,960 --> 00:15:25,464
<c.simplifiedchinese>真的想知道的话就打赢我吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

237
00:15:25,547 --> 00:15:28,467
<c.simplifiedchinese>但我要说一句</c.simplifiedchinese>

238
00:15:28,550 --> 00:15:31,345
<c.simplifiedchinese>我讨厌维新志士</c.simplifiedchinese>

239
00:15:31,428 --> 00:15:34,932
<c.simplifiedchinese>你们都是伪君子</c.simplifiedchinese>

240
00:15:35,015 --> 00:15:38,268
<c.simplifiedchinese>你们顶着正义的头衔为所欲为</c.simplifiedchinese>

241
00:15:38,352 --> 00:15:43,899
<c.simplifiedchinese>除掉挡道的人 即使不得不歪曲事实</c.simplifiedchinese>

242
00:15:43,982 --> 00:15:48,028
<c.simplifiedchinese>说什么四民平等
这种漂亮话都是谎言！</c.simplifiedchinese>

243
00:15:48,111 --> 00:15:52,741
<c.simplifiedchinese>所以我想全心全意地灭了你</c.simplifiedchinese>

244
00:15:52,824 --> 00:15:55,953
<c.simplifiedchinese>传说中最厉害的维新志士刽子手！</c.simplifiedchinese>

245
00:16:02,584 --> 00:16:04,962
<c.simplifiedchinese>明白了 在下接受你的挑战</c.simplifiedchinese>

246
00:16:05,045 --> 00:16:06,171
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心！</c.simplifiedchinese>

247
00:16:06,880 --> 00:16:08,840
<c.simplifiedchinese>但先回答在下一个问题</c.simplifiedchinese>

248
00:16:09,549 --> 00:16:13,136
<c.simplifiedchinese>是比留间兄弟雇你来的吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

249
00:16:13,220 --> 00:16:16,431
<c.simplifiedchinese>对 你怎么知道？</c.simplifiedchinese>

250
00:16:16,515 --> 00:16:21,186
<c.simplifiedchinese>这城里没多少人知道在下的过往</c.simplifiedchinese>

251
00:16:21,269 --> 00:16:26,775
<c.simplifiedchinese>而且栅栏后面传来肮脏的杀气</c.simplifiedchinese>

252
00:16:26,858 --> 00:16:28,819
<c.simplifiedchinese>出来吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

253
00:16:28,902 --> 00:16:32,030
<c.simplifiedchinese>你真的是厉害的剑客</c.simplifiedchinese>

254
00:16:32,114 --> 00:16:34,700
<c.simplifiedchinese>喂 你俩出来吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

255
00:16:36,076 --> 00:16:38,412
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们说了 快出来</c.simplifiedchinese>

256
00:16:45,460 --> 00:16:47,921
<c.simplifiedchinese>来吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

257
00:16:48,005 --> 00:16:50,465
<c.simplifiedchinese>-交出来吧
-什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

258
00:16:50,549 --> 00:16:52,551
<c.simplifiedchinese>别“什么”！</c.simplifiedchinese>

259
00:16:53,635 --> 00:16:54,886
<c.simplifiedchinese>果然</c.simplifiedchinese>

260
00:16:55,637 --> 00:16:59,266
<c.simplifiedchinese>我知道你这种混蛋想干什么</c.simplifiedchinese>

261
00:16:59,349 --> 00:17:00,851
<c.simplifiedchinese>听着</c.simplifiedchinese>

262
00:17:00,934 --> 00:17:06,231
<c.simplifiedchinese>你雇我来打这场架
但付钱后 这场架就是我的了</c.simplifiedchinese>

263
00:17:06,314 --> 00:17:07,899
<c.simplifiedchinese>任何这样的破小动作…</c.simplifiedchinese>

264
00:17:10,736 --> 00:17:12,904
<c.simplifiedchinese>绝不允许出现</c.simplifiedchinese>

265
00:17:14,448 --> 00:17:15,615
<c.simplifiedchinese>喜兵卫…</c.simplifiedchinese>

266
00:17:18,076 --> 00:17:22,247
<c.simplifiedchinese>这块地是我的 丫头！</c.simplifiedchinese>

267
00:17:28,003 --> 00:17:31,631
<c.simplifiedchinese>道场有点小</c.simplifiedchinese>

268
00:17:31,715 --> 00:17:33,383
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们去河边解决吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

269
00:17:44,770 --> 00:17:46,563
<c.simplifiedchinese>天 他太显眼了</c.simplifiedchinese>

270
00:17:46,646 --> 00:17:48,106
<c.simplifiedchinese>-弥彦
-嗯？</c.simplifiedchinese>

271
00:17:48,190 --> 00:17:51,318
<c.simplifiedchinese>你…被吓到了吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

272
00:17:51,401 --> 00:17:53,111
<c.simplifiedchinese>有点</c.simplifiedchinese>

273
00:17:53,195 --> 00:17:54,780
<c.simplifiedchinese>但不是特别怕</c.simplifiedchinese>

274
00:17:54,863 --> 00:17:56,698
<c.simplifiedchinese>就算你是刽子手 我也不怕你</c.simplifiedchinese>

275
00:17:56,782 --> 00:18:01,161
<c.simplifiedchinese>不如说 知道你为什么
像恶魔那么厉害后</c.simplifiedchinese>

276
00:18:01,244 --> 00:18:03,330
<c.simplifiedchinese>有点欣慰</c.simplifiedchinese>

277
00:18:05,123 --> 00:18:07,250
<c.simplifiedchinese>别说我了 你还好吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

278
00:18:07,334 --> 00:18:08,543
<c.simplifiedchinese>哦啰？</c.simplifiedchinese>

279
00:18:08,627 --> 00:18:10,295
<c.simplifiedchinese>“哦啰”什么啊？</c.simplifiedchinese>

280
00:18:10,378 --> 00:18:12,339
<c.simplifiedchinese>看那个</c.simplifiedchinese>

281
00:18:12,422 --> 00:18:14,925
<c.simplifiedchinese>看那样子 那应该是矛</c.simplifiedchinese>

282
00:18:15,008 --> 00:18:20,055
<c.simplifiedchinese>据说矛对剑的话 他会比你厉害三倍</c.simplifiedchinese>

283
00:18:20,138 --> 00:18:21,890
<c.simplifiedchinese>不是矛 孩子</c.simplifiedchinese>

284
00:18:21,973 --> 00:18:24,810
<c.simplifiedchinese>是比矛更厉害的武器</c.simplifiedchinese>

285
00:18:26,937 --> 00:18:30,315
<c.simplifiedchinese>对了 让我做下自我介绍</c.simplifiedchinese>

286
00:18:34,027 --> 00:18:36,780
<c.simplifiedchinese>我的名字是相乐左之助</c.simplifiedchinese>

287
00:18:36,863 --> 00:18:39,908
<c.simplifiedchinese>黑帮里人称斩左</c.simplifiedchinese>

288
00:18:39,991 --> 00:18:42,244
<c.simplifiedchinese>持斩马刀的左之助</c.simplifiedchinese>

289
00:18:42,327 --> 00:18:44,246
<c.simplifiedchinese>简称斩左</c.simplifiedchinese>

290
00:18:44,329 --> 00:18:45,455
<c.simplifiedchinese>斩马刀！</c.simplifiedchinese>

291
00:18:46,873 --> 00:18:48,583
<c.simplifiedchinese>斩马刀</c.simplifiedchinese>

292
00:18:48,667 --> 00:18:54,881
<c.simplifiedchinese>战国时代前发明的巨型刀
用于一刀拿下骑手及马</c.simplifiedchinese>

293
00:18:54,965 --> 00:18:56,424
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是迄今最重的刀</c.simplifiedchinese>

294
00:18:56,508 --> 00:19:00,387
<c.simplifiedchinese>据说因为它太重了
未曾有人能完美驾驭</c.simplifiedchinese>

295
00:19:00,470 --> 00:19:03,098
<c.simplifiedchinese>我听说过</c.simplifiedchinese>

296
00:19:03,181 --> 00:19:05,225
<c.simplifiedchinese>斩左的“最佳拍档”</c.simplifiedchinese>

297
00:19:05,308 --> 00:19:08,270
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是应仁之乱时的古老兵器
所以形态不是那么完美了</c.simplifiedchinese>

298
00:19:08,353 --> 00:19:10,230
<c.simplifiedchinese>虽然是把刀 但根本没有刀刃</c.simplifiedchinese>

299
00:19:10,897 --> 00:19:14,401
<c.simplifiedchinese>但我可以用它来粉身碎骨</c.simplifiedchinese>

300
00:19:15,026 --> 00:19:16,945
<c.simplifiedchinese>浪客绯村剑心</c.simplifiedchinese>

301
00:19:17,779 --> 00:19:19,364
<c.simplifiedchinese>持逆刃刀</c.simplifiedchinese>

302
00:19:19,447 --> 00:19:21,908
<c.simplifiedchinese>但可能已经不是什么新鲜事了</c.simplifiedchinese>

303
00:19:22,701 --> 00:19:24,578
<c.simplifiedchinese>因为你做了调查了</c.simplifiedchinese>

304
00:19:25,287 --> 00:19:28,540
<c.simplifiedchinese>对 给你条建议吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

305
00:19:29,166 --> 00:19:32,586
<c.simplifiedchinese>别想着可怜我 不置我于死地</c.simplifiedchinese>

306
00:19:32,669 --> 00:19:34,087
<c.simplifiedchinese>不然 你将会是那个…</c.simplifiedchinese>

307
00:19:34,171 --> 00:19:36,882
<c.simplifiedchinese>-于死地的人！
-好快！</c.simplifiedchinese>

308
00:19:56,568 --> 00:19:57,819
<c.simplifiedchinese>当然</c.simplifiedchinese>

309
00:19:57,903 --> 00:20:02,824
<c.simplifiedchinese>不管他的斩马刀有多大
一击不中也没关系！</c.simplifiedchinese>

310
00:20:03,825 --> 00:20:06,119
<c.simplifiedchinese>当然是剑心赢了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

311
00:20:11,374 --> 00:20:13,376
<c.simplifiedchinese>和我听说的一样厉害</c.simplifiedchinese>

312
00:20:13,460 --> 00:20:14,961
<c.simplifiedchinese>怪不得成为传奇</c.simplifiedchinese>

313
00:20:16,421 --> 00:20:17,631
<c.simplifiedchinese>但是…</c.simplifiedchinese>

314
00:20:19,925 --> 00:20:21,259
<c.simplifiedchinese>不好</c.simplifiedchinese>

315
00:20:21,343 --> 00:20:24,137
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们误判他的实力了</c.simplifiedchinese>

316
00:20:25,013 --> 00:20:30,101
<c.simplifiedchinese>他的真实实力不是用力挥斩马刀</c.simplifiedchinese>

317
00:20:30,185 --> 00:20:34,272
<c.simplifiedchinese>或一弹弹倒大块头的神力</c.simplifiedchinese>

318
00:20:34,898 --> 00:20:38,151
<c.simplifiedchinese>他连眉心挨了寸铁都不皱下眉</c.simplifiedchinese>

319
00:20:38,235 --> 00:20:40,820
<c.simplifiedchinese>他卓然超群的忍耐力才是他的实力！</c.simplifiedchinese>

320
00:20:40,904 --> 00:20:47,202
<c.simplifiedchinese>目前为止 所有敌人
都被剑心的飞天御剑流一击倒下</c.simplifiedchinese>

321
00:20:47,285 --> 00:20:50,580
<c.simplifiedchinese>但对这个人却没有任何影响</c.simplifiedchinese>

322
00:20:54,084 --> 00:20:58,255
<c.simplifiedchinese>真正的战斗不像决斗</c.simplifiedchinese>

323
00:20:58,338 --> 00:21:00,507
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑术高明的人不一定总能赢</c.simplifiedchinese>

324
00:21:01,091 --> 00:21:03,718
<c.simplifiedchinese>还站在战场上的才是赢家！</c.simplifiedchinese>

325
00:21:05,011 --> 00:21:06,638
<c.simplifiedchinese>等你最后还站在战场上</c.simplifiedchinese>

326
00:21:07,264 --> 00:21:10,850
<c.simplifiedchinese>再说这番话吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

327
00:22:46,863 --> 00:22:50,158
<c.simplifiedchinese>下一回 《就这样多了一名伙伴》</c.simplifiedchinese>

